/NM (cf59dc78-b83b-4e1f-b2b811c86a071afb)
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.8" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">They are shared among VSAM data sets accessed by tasks in the same address space. &#13;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">This configuration is a centralized way for buffer management. Instead of having individual &#13;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">buffer pools, you have a large one shared by several VSAM data sets, improving the &#13;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">utilization of the buffer pool resource.&#13;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">&#13;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:12.0pt">DFSMSrmm builds an LSR buffer pool for the DFRMM started procedure,</span></p></body>)
/Rect [468.550965 540.933661 489.171418 592.108759]
/Subj (Highlight)
/Popup 64 0 R
/Subtype /Highlight
/Contents (They are shared among VSAM data sets accessed by tasks in the same address space. \rThis configuration is a centralized way for buffer management. Instead of having individual \rbuffer pools, you have a large one shared by several VSAM data sets, improving the \rutilization of the buffer pool resource.\r\rDFSMSrmm builds an LSR buffer pool for the DFRMM started procedure,)
/QuadPoints [468.550974 545.159782 468.550974 587.882603 489.171405 545.159782 489.171405 587.882603]
/CreationDate (D:20130311102207+08'00')
